Package: ocvpn
Version: 1.3.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, curl, python3, unzip, iptables, procps
Maintainer: OTumanov
Description: Transparent routing of opencode endpoints through VLESS VPN
 ocvpn routes only traffic to opencode.ai infrastructure and configured
 model-provider endpoints (port 443) through a VLESS VPN via xray,
 using iptables REDIRECT on Linux and pf rdr on macOS.
 Everything else on the host goes direct.
 .
 Ships a systemd unit (daemon mode, terminal stays free) and a macOS
 GUI app (one button + logs).
